                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As of October 18, 2026 I can confirm online play still functions despite what other reviews may say. Played multiple hours with friends with no issues. And the 2 most common problems are easily addressed. \n\n1- The Play button not working. Just hit return to the main menu and press play again. Everyone I know who has had the issue has made it in after only a few attempts. Just keep trying. Possible that adjusting your resolution may perma-fix this?\n\n2- The game not launching can be fixed by applying a startup command. You should be able to find it easily in the steam discussions, and it will take you longer to read how to fix it than to actually apply it. (An extremely quick fix, applied once.)",
